date A is best despite attitude concerns? He has leadership, anticipation, spatial vision (important for navigation). Show-off may be mitigated; not open to new ideas could be a concern but maybe less than nasty remarks.\n\nWe need to state recommendation. Since no prior discussion, we can propose a candidate and give reasoning.\n\nLet's choose Candidate A as provisional recommendation, citing strengths and acknowledging concerns, but argue they are outweighed.\n\nWe must include vote in METADATA_JSON.\n\nProceed."}
